================================================================
  musil: library reference (std)
================================================================

--- vectors ---
range 5         : (0 1 2 3 4)
range 2 5       : (2 3 4)
range 0 1 0.25  : (0 0.25 0.5 0.75)
range 5 0 -1    : (5 4 3 2 1)
linspace 0 1 5  : (0 0.25 0.5 0.75 1)
zeros 4, ones 3 : (0 0 0 0) (1 1 1)
sort            : (1 1 2 3 4 5 6 9)
mean, stdev     : 3.875 2.57087047515039
prod            : 24
dot, norm       : 32 5
cumsum          : (1 3 6 10)
normalize       : (0 0.5 1)
clip -5..5 to 0..1: (0 0.5 1)
fixed pi 3      : 3.142 (a rounded number; fmt-fixed below gives a string)
diff            : (3 5 7)
argmin, argmax  : 1 5
median          : 3.5 2.5
quantile 0.25   : 2.5
histogram 3 bins: ((4 3 1) (1 3.66666666666667 6.33333333333333 9)) (counts, then the bin edges)
interp1         : (0 5 5 0) (clamped outside the table)

--- scalar math ---
constants tau euler phi ln2 sqrt2: 6.28318530717959 2.71828182845905 1.61803398874989 0.693147180559945 1.4142135623731
sign (vec -3 0 2): (-1 0 1)
even? 4, odd? 4  : 1 0
between? 5 1 10  : 1
hypot 3 4        : 5
gcd 48 18, lcm 4 6: 6 12
lerp 0 10 0.25   : 2.5
map-range 5 0 10 0 100: 50
deg->rad 180     : 3.14159265358979
rad->deg pi      : 180

--- sequences ---
last            : e 6 z
reverse         : (e d c b a) (3 2 1) cba
slice L 1 3     : (b c d)
slice L 3       : (d e) (to the end)
slice L -2      : (d e) (negative start counts from the end)
take 2, drop 3  : (a b) (d e)
find            : 2 5 2 (-1 when absent)
contains?       : 1 1
concat-list     : (1 2 3)
flatten         : (1 2 3)
zip             : ((x 1) (y 2))
unique          : (1 2 3)
sort-list       : (apple fig pear) (1 2 3)
min-of, max-of  : 1 3

--- strings ---
concat          : hello, world! 42
split           : (a b c d) (a b c)
join            : x-y-z
upper, lower    : MUSIL musil
trim            : [hi]
format          : Robert is 42 years old
chr 65, ord "A"  : A 65
starts/ends-with?: 1 1
replace         : a+b+c
count-substr    : 2
repeat          : ababab
pad-left/right  : 007 ab..
fmt-fixed pi 4  : 3.1416 (a string with exactly 4 decimals)
fmt-fixed 2 3   : 2.000
fmt-pct 0.752 1 : 75.2%

--- higher-order (polymorphic on list and vec) ---
map list, vec   : (1 4 9) (1 4 9)
filter          : (0 3 6 9)
reduce          : 10 ab
any?, all?      : 1 1
count           : 3
each (side effects): (10 20 30)
  times: 0
  times: 1
  times: 2
identity, compose: 7 16
map with a partial: (101 102 103)

--- files ---
exists?         : 1
read            :
first line
second line
third line

write non-string: (1 2 3)

--- testing ---
assert          : reference_std.mu:134: assertion failed: one is not two
assert-equal    : std.mu: lists: expected (2), got (1)
  1> assert-equal() at reference_std.mu:135
assert-near     : nil (nil: passed)
assert-near fail: std.mu: off: expected 2 within 0.1, got 1
  1> assert-near() at reference_std.mu:137

================================================================
  end of std reference
================================================================
